                          File upload vulnerabilites

# File upload vulnerabilites are when a web server allows users to uplaod files to its fle system without 
 -suffficiently validating things like thier name , type , contents , or size.

### Impact of File upload vulnerabilites 
- Depends on two key factors
1. which aspect of the file the website fails to validate properly ,whether that be its size , type contents, and so on.
2. what restrictions are imposed on the file once it has been successfully uploaded.


